        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Canon edge classes\n\nThe relationships the primitives declare, and the three kinds of connection drawn between graphs, each defined by a graph. The app reads this list to learn which connections are legal.\n\n- `surface`\n- `view-sequence`\n- `landing-surface`\n- `invokes`\n- `membrane`\n- `listens`\n- `surface-delegate`\n- `exposes-port`\n- `bridge`\n- `portal`\n- `link`"
        }
      }
    }
